"url=\"https://bibtexml.sourceforge.net\">BibTex</ulink>, and <ulink "
"url=\"https://mcj.sourceforge.net/\">Transfig</ulink> (all four to build the"
" API documentation), and <xref linkend=\"valgrind\"/>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"sdl\"/> e <xref linkend=\"libpng\"/> (ambos para construir "
"os reprodutores de exemplo), <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"texlive\"/> (ou <xref linkend=\"tl-installer\"/>), <ulink "
"url=\"https://bibtexml.sourceforge.net\">BibTex</ulink> e <ulink "
"url=\"https://mcj.sourceforge.net/\">Transfig</ulink> (todos os quatro para "
"construir a documentação da API) e <xref linkend=\"valgrind\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libtheora.xml:97
msgid "Installation of libtheora"
msgstr "Instalação do libtheora"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libtheora.xml:100
msgid ""
"Install <application>libtheora</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>libtheora</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libtheora.xml:104
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i 's/png_\\(sizeof\\)/\\1/g' examples/png2theora.c &amp;&amp;\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i 's/png_\\(sizeof\\)/\\1/g' examples/png2theora.c &amp;&amp;\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libtheora.xml:109
msgid "If you wish to run the tests, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr ""
"Se você desejar executar os testes, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libtheora.xml:113
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libtheora.xml:116
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libtheora.xml:119
msgid ""
"If you wish to install the examples (so that you can hack on "
"<literal>theora</literal>), install them as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você desejar instalar os exemplos (de forma que consiga hackear o "
"<literal>theora</literal>), instale-os como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libtheora.xml:124
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>cd examples/.libs &amp;&amp;\n"
"for E in *; do\n"
"  install -v -m755 $E /usr/bin/theora_${E}\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cd examples/.libs &amp;&amp;\n"
"for E in *; do\n"
"  install -v -m755 $E /usr/bin/theora_${E}\n"
"done</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libtheora.xml:132
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações dos Comandos"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libtheora.xml:135
msgid ""
"<command>sed -i 's/png_\\(sizeof\\)/\\1/g' examples/png2theora.c</command>: "
"This <command>sed</command> fixes build with "
"<application>libpng</application> 1.6."
msgstr ""
"<command>sed -i 's/png_\\(sizeof\\)/\\1/g' examples/png2theora.c</command>: "
"Esse <command>sed</command> corrige a construção com a "
"<application>libpng</application> 1.6."

